title: Work the SLD Machine
subtitle: The recurring work of an apparatus party: regional chairs, doctrine and list control
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
frequency: 150
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_sld_machine_timer <= 0 and sld_partocracy_stage >= 3
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_sld_machine_timer = 4
card-image: img/poland/cards/party-affairs.webp

= Work the SLD Machine

The route has no separate local-machine simulation. Its offices, money,
dissent and list discipline remain the same party qualities used everywhere
else; this month decides which of them the apparatus spends.

- @regional_chairs
- @orthodox_tour
- @market_mayors
- @close_lists

@regional_chairs
title: Call every regional chair and repair the weak counties
subtitle: Reliable organisational growth; another month led from offices rather than movements
on-arrival: local_network += 5; barons_strength += 3; list_confidence += 3; resources -= 1 if resources > 0; organiser_energy -= 2; young_support -= 1; sld_patronage_exposure += 2; news_headline = "SLD regional chairs repair the weakest county organisations"

The map is divided into places with a functioning chair and places that need
one. Rooms, treasurers and candidate files follow. No viral clip results, and
the list will be ready on time.

- #poland_card_finish

@orthodox_tour
title: Take pensions and the secular state through the old SLD electorate
subtitle: Strongest on the orthodox route; a clear message to older voters and a weak recruitment pitch
choose-if: sld_partocracy_doctrine = "orthodox"
unavailable-subtitle: This action belongs to the orthodox SLD doctrine.
on-arrival: pensioner_support += 5; public_sector_support += 2; public_mood_pending_secular_state_left_ownership += 4; party_unity += 2; turnout_readiness += 2; young_support -= 2; organiser_energy -= 2; news_headline = "SLD tours the pension and secular-state programme"

The meetings fill with people who remember both the party and the institutions
it says it will defend. The platform is coherent, loyal and older at the end of
the month than it was at the beginning.

- #poland_card_finish

@market_mayors
title: Put mayors, managers and municipal delivery on the stage
subtitle: Strongest on the market route; money and competence rise while labour trust falls
choose-if: sld_partocracy_doctrine = "market_apparatus"
unavailable-subtitle: This action belongs to the market-apparatus doctrine.
on-arrival: resources += 2; local_network += 3; administrative_capacity += 4; government_delivery += 2; liberal_professionals_left_affinity += 2; union_trust -= 3; labor_dissent += 4; workers_support -= 1; news_headline = "SLD mayors sell administrative competence to business and the centre"

The people on stage can point to roads, accounts and services they actually
administer. Donors hear competence. Union delegates hear a month in which
efficiency was discussed without anybody naming who does the work.

- #poland_card_finish

@close_lists
title: Close the candidate lists before anyone can reopen the programme
subtitle: Strongest on the partocracy route; discipline and turnout capacity grow with exposure and distrust
choose-if: sld_partocracy_doctrine = "partocracy"
unavailable-subtitle: This action belongs to the reform-avoidant partocracy doctrine.
on-arrival: list_confidence += 6; leadership_authority += 3; barons_strength += 3; turnout_readiness += 3; party_unity += 2; organiser_energy -= 3; public_trust -= 2; progressives_dissent += 3; razem_dissent += 3; sld_patronage_exposure += 5; government_coalition_dissent += 1 if left_in_government = 1; news_headline = "SLD closes disciplined lists months ahead of its rivals"

Every incumbent knows the district, every district knows the whip and every
challenger learns that the programme convention is not an appeal court. The
campaign becomes easier to administer and harder to love.

- #poland_card_finish
